      "id": "claim_20e9b03d8b48400cabcfae2473c5aaea",
      "statement": "The Context singleton uses observer strategy C (data-set tracking) because it is a broad binding over public and account-private collections: ContextObserverTracker keeps per-collection observed states (true/pending/observed) and per-observer verifiers in KV, ContextVerifier.hasCollectionAccess checks ownership or publicness within the same sharing domain (a domain mismatch returns false outright), and addObserver re-verifies each new observer against every tracked collection.",
