      "statement": "Data-revealing reads route through prepareObservation(collectionIds) rather than authorizeObservation directly: unknown sets are marked pending synchronously before the first await, current observers are re-checked against each newly-touched set with failing ones becoming excludeObservers, and pending sets are promoted to observed only after authorizeObservation succeeds — the two-state protocol closes admission races in either request ordering.",
